# CelestinaStyle — importable straight from the source tree.
#
# The CMake build produces the compiled module; this file is the same contract
# for anything that runs the plain QML (a `qml6` tool, a small session helper),
# so a surface can wear the suite's language without a build step. Both must
# list the same types — a component missing here is a component the tooling
# cannot see.
module CelestinaStyle

singleton CelestinaTheme 1.0 CelestinaTheme.qml
singleton CelestinaIcons 1.0 CelestinaIcons.qml

CelestinaSurface 1.0 CelestinaSurface.qml
CelestinaBackdrop 1.0 CelestinaBackdrop.qml
CelestinaButton 1.0 CelestinaButton.qml
CelestinaShadow 1.0 CelestinaShadow.qml
CelestinaIconButton 1.0 CelestinaIconButton.qml
CelestinaCapsule 1.0 CelestinaCapsule.qml
CelestinaRowHighlight 1.0 CelestinaRowHighlight.qml
CelestinaIcon 1.0 CelestinaIcon.qml
CelestinaSectionLabel 1.0 CelestinaSectionLabel.qml
CelestinaFocusRing 1.0 CelestinaFocusRing.qml
CelestinaTextField 1.0 CelestinaTextField.qml
CelestinaSlider 1.0 CelestinaSlider.qml
CelestinaScrollBar 1.0 CelestinaScrollBar.qml
CelestinaLineGutter 1.0 CelestinaLineGutter.qml
CelestinaSwitch 1.0 CelestinaSwitch.qml
ListSection 1.0 ListSection.qml
CelestinaInputShield 1.0 CelestinaInputShield.qml
CelestinaFolderIcon 1.0 CelestinaFolderIcon.qml
CelestinaFileIcon 1.0 CelestinaFileIcon.qml
singleton CelestinaIconShapes 1.0 CelestinaIconShapes.qml
CelestinaModalLayer 1.0 CelestinaModalLayer.qml
GlassSurface 1.0 GlassSurface.qml
GlassCard 1.0 GlassCard.qml
GlassContextMenu 1.0 GlassContextMenu.qml
GlassMenuItem 1.0 GlassMenuItem.qml
